 "text": "Dodge County GIS Hub\n-->\n-->\nSkip Navigation\nAdd to Favorites\nShare\nShare\nAdd to Favorites\nShare\nShare\nClose\nSign In\nExplore\nData\nDocuments\nApps & Maps\nRecent Downloads\nNew\nSign In\nDodge County GIS Hub\nRecorded Plats\nROW Maps\nRecreation & History\nOpen data and Contacts\nPublic Facilities\nCemeteries\nMore\nRecorded Plats\nROW Maps\nRecreation & History\nOpen data and Contacts\nPublic Facilities\nCemeteries\nDodge County, Minnesota\nGIS Hub\nDodge County GeoHub is a customized website for exploring GIS web mapping applications, link to historic plats, submit data requests, and access County stories through Story Maps.\nNOTICE: THE PARCEL VIEWER MAPS HAS CHANGED LINKS. PLEASE UPDATE YOUR BOOKMARKS. IF THERE ARE ANY QUESTIONS ABOUT HOW TO USE THE NEW APP, PLEASE FOLLOW THE LINK HERE , OR CONTACT BRYAN BYHOLM AT 651-385-3193 OR BRYAN.BYHOLM@GOODHUECOUNTYMN.GOV\nInteractive Maps\nClick the images below\nParcel Viewer\nPublic Lands Survey Points\nProperty Information\nAdopt a Highway\nThings to do in Dodge County\nClick the images below\nMISSION\nThe mission of the GIS office is to develop, implement, and maintain a GIS database for the county departments, local government agencies, private companies, and the general public. The County GIS office is responsible for acquiring the necessary data for the county, performing quality analysis checks to ensure its accuracy and source information, and for the maintenance of the GIS system. The resulting GIS will create an effective land records management system that facilitates information gathering and provides accurate and timely information to the county departments and the public.\nDATA DISCLAIMER\nDodge County assumes NO liability for the accuracy or completeness of the data contained in these applications OR responsibility for any associated direct, indirect, or consequential damages that may result from it use or misuse. Geospatial datasets represented have not been located using surveying methods. This data is not considered a survey, is not legally recorded, and is not intended to be used as such. Dodge County copyright 2024.\nContact\nBryan Byholm - GIS Specialist Dodge and Goodhue County\n(651) 385-3193 or bryan.byholm@goodhuecountymn.gov\nDodge County Land Records Office\n(507) 635-6245 or 721 N Main St, Mantorville, MN 55955\nGIS Links\nEsri.com Home\nSE MN GIS Users Group\nMinnesota GIS/LIS Consortium\nMinnesota Geospatial Commons\nCopyright 2024. Dodge County Online Maps.\nBuilt with\nArcGIS Hub\nExplore Feeds\nShare",
